{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22462","headline":"不二门 · 白居易","name":"不二门","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"两眼日将闇，四肢渐衰瘦。\n束带賸昔围，穿衣妨宽袖。\n流年似江水，奔注无昏昼。\n志气与形骸，安得长依旧。\n亦曾登玉陛，举措多纰缪。\n至今金阙籍，名姓独遗漏。\n亦曾烧大药，消息乖火候。\n至今残丹砂，烧乾不成就。\n行藏事两失，忧恼心交鬬。\n化作顦顇翁，抛身在荒陋。\n坐看老病逼，须得医王救。\n唯有不二门，其间无夭寿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22462.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22462","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}